Comment: 0,0:04:02.07,0:04:04.80,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Every day's unique, you get one chance at it
Comment: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:06.86,OP,,0,0,0,kara,So you'd better make it count
Comment: 0,0:04:07.11,0:04:09.79,OP,,0,0,0,kara,When people flaunt morality
Comment: 0,0:04:10.03,0:04:13.50,OP,,0,0,0,kara,You've gotta beware they've got their own agenda
Comment: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:16.44,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Somewhere in your head, there's a voice that's messin' with ya
Comment: 0,0:04:16.55,0:04:18.44,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Don't ever let it turn you 'round
Comment: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:22.13,OP,,0,0,0,kara,It can't even blow all that hot air it's full of
Comment: 0,0:04:22.33,0:04:25.07,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Get yourself in gear and live however you wanna
Comment: 0,0:04:25.21,0:04:30.11,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Live so fast that the claws of despair will languish in your dust
Comment: 0,0:04:30.27,0:04:34.13,OP,,0,0,0,kara,And you'll be the one with an agenda that they'll all see as just
Comment: 0,0:04:36.15,0:04:38.95,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,Keep on shouldering the world around you
Comment: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:41.69,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,Keep on doubting every thought that's bound you
Comment: 0,0:04:41.83,0:04:43.62,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,If things go awry, keep pushing through
Comment: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:46.47,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,And know that everything'll work in the end
Comment: 0,0:04:47.81,0:04:50.51,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,If you find it's in your power to change the world
Comment: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:53.19,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,I'm sure you can make the future bright
Comment: 0,0:04:53.43,0:04:57.37,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,We'll blaze on ahead until we track down the route we want to take
Comment: 0,0:04:59.35,0:05:03.04,OP,,0,0,0,kara,We'll keep trying every door until we find one that goes our way
Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.36,0:00:06.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop this!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.87,Main,,0,0,0,,No more! They're going to die!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.76,0:00:12.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.16,0:00:14.04,Main,,0,0,0,,This is exactly what they deserve.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.57,0:00:18.28,Main,,0,0,0,,You showed up late for a date with me, your own fiancée,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.28,0:00:22.87,Main,,0,0,0,,because you were too busy drinking the night away with these commoners.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.87,0:00:24.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.95,0:00:31.39,Main,,0,0,0,,How strange!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.39,0:00:33.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't know a human could make a sound like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.89,0:00:35.99,Main,,0,0,0,,You learn something new every day!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.52,0:00:40.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Guess what? I knew this would happen.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.31,0:00:44.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I saw your future. I knew you'd be\N getting wasted at the pub that morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.34,0:00:46.15,Main,,0,0,0,,You knew?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.15,0:00:51.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. The entire time, from the day I met you.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.40,0:00:54.03,Main,,0,0,0,,So, Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.03,0:00:59.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Every man and woman here\N got to spend the night with you, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.11,0:01:03.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm getting jealous.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.33,0:01:04.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.90,0:01:07.80,Main,,0,0,0,,The fault is all my own!\N They've done nothing to deserve this!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.14,0:01:09.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.05,0:01:10.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.55,0:01:11.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.00,0:01:16.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then, here's a question for you, my beloved Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.12,0:01:23.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you willingly choose to spend\N all night with these filthy Anemonians
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.39,0:01:28.19,Main,,0,0,0,,instead of spending the morning with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.58,0:01:32.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Because if so, these people are innocent,\Nand I shall release them.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.36,0:01:35.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I take responsibility for all of it! So please!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.63,0:01:37.10,Main,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.10,0:01:41.96,Main,,0,0,0,,That means you committed treason against me,\N and by extension the Kingdom of Freesia, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.30,0:01:47.21,Main,,0,0,0,,That's grounds for Freesia to launch\N an immediate invasion of the Kingdom of Anemone.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.21,0:01:48.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Invasion?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.96,0:01:50.57,Main,,0,0,0,,What else would you expect?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.57,0:01:54.61,Main,,0,0,0,,After all, you've humiliated me, the queen.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.61,0:01:59.97,Main,,0,0,0,,We're going to raze\Nyour whole nation to the very ground.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.26,0:02:04.48,Main,,0,0,0,,If they are the ones to blame, then they will be executed here.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.48,0:02:07.27,Main,,0,0,0,,If you are to blame, then we go to war.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.98,0:02:09.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, which is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.94,0:02:11.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Are they at fault?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.74,0:02:14.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Or... Are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.40,0:02:17.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.76,0:02:20.17,Main,,0,0,0,,not to blame!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.95,0:02:23.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He's lying!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.19,0:02:24.67,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Prince Leon!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.67,0:02:26.20,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He's wrong! Please, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.20,0:02:27.78,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We're innocent!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.56,0:02:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.92,0:02:26.20,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the only explanation!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.52,0:02:31.21,Main,,0,0,0,,So, Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.56,0:02:34.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you love me?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.35,0:02:37.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, I love you! I love you!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.08,0:02:39.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I-I lo... I love you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.03,0:02:41.36,Main,,0,0,0,,S-S-So I beg you...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.36,0:02:44.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Prove it to me, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.06,0:02:52.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Execute them all, by your own hand.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.40,0:02:53.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Prince Leon...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.80,0:02:54.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.94,0:02:56.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Just kill me...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.04,0:02:54.41,Alt,,0,0,0,,I had faith in you...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.41,0:02:56.16,Alt,,0,0,0,,We beg you...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.40,0:02:57.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.84,0:02:59.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone's suffering!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.22,0:03:03.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry and put them out of their misery.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.23,0:03:07.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, do it now, sweet prince!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.25,0:03:26.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I love you so much, Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.51,0:03:35.07,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.07,0:03:37.03,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why am I here?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.21,0:05:22.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Say, mister, did you get left behind?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.62,0:05:28.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of fun he got up to\Nbefore he made it here.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.68,0:05:31.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave him be!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.04,0:05:35.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems like the blokes he was with\Njust got dragged along on his little bender.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.34,0:05:38.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever, let the guy have as much fun as he wants!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.76,0:05:41.60,Main,,0,0,0,,They left plenty of coin behind, after all!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.60,0:05:44.20,Main,,0,0,0,,We're drinkin' 'til the sun comes up!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.52,0:05:47.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My people.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.49,0:05:55.84,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm so close to their voices,\N and their smiles, like I wanted to be.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.44,0:05:58.09,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.09,0:06:01.26,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wanted to see them.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.57,0:06:05.85,Main,,0,0,0,,{\t(1630,2120,1,\c&H000000&)}You must not leave the castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.10,0:06:08.63,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.63,0:06:10.97,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who told me that?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.97,0:06:13.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Especially on the last day.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.70,0:06:15.54,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The last day?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.86,0:06:18.43,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What... did that mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.43,0:06:21.13,Main,,0,0,0,,That is when you will lose everything.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.59,0:06:24.45,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have a feeling it was very important.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.06,0:06:26.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's struggling.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.41,0:06:33.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel a little better.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.83,0:06:37.61,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You'll be forced to drink excessively, and at the pub the morning after...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.61,0:06:38.91,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pub?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.25,0:06:41.72,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I drunk, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.72,0:06:44.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Alcohol's never made me feel like this before.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.17,0:06:49.18,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...you will lose the trust\Nof your people, as well as the king.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.76,0:06:52.16,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lose their trust?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.16,0:06:53.89,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I-I don't want that.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.89,0:06:56.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, I sure would like to see his face.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.10,0:06:59.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Me too. Let's get this hat off of him.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.72,0:07:01.05,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.05,0:07:03.15,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't let them see my face!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.52,0:07:06.17,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No! No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.17,0:07:07.87,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Someone... Help me!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.40,0:07:15.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.27,0:07:16.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't see a thing!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.97,0:07:17.85,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.85,0:07:18.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Who put out the lights?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.95,0:07:22.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Something's covering the lamps and I can't get them lit again!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.05,0:07:23.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Who the hell covered them up?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.19,0:07:25.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Up you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.87,0:07:31.38,Main,,0,0,0,,That was some pretty good booze.\NThanks for the drinks.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.68,0:07:42.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Mistress.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.23,0:07:43.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Running a little late, eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.11,0:07:45.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Val.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.16,0:07:47.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for all you've done this past week.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.34,0:07:50.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Got your goods right over here.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.60,0:07:53.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Quite the pretty boy, isn't he?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.87,0:07:56.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You've already moved him to safety?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.12,0:07:58.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.66,0:08:01.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Just like you asked.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.77,0:08:04.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I want you to watch over Crown Prince Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.54,0:08:10.08,Main,,0,0,0,,He got smashed at the pub,\N and they almost took his hat off...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.59,0:08:14.70,Main,,0,0,0,,but right before then, I knocked out the lights,\N snatched him up, and came here.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.50,0:08:21.37,Main,,0,0,0,,It was super awesome!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.59,0:08:23.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Val.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.13,0:08:33.62,Main,,0,0,0,,He was awake when I grabbed him...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.15,0:08:37.40,Main,,0,0,0,,But after I carried him\N all the way here, he fell back asleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.25,0:08:42.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Philip.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.27,0:08:47.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Val, you'll all need to join us.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.52,0:08:51.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Please tell me more about what happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.36,0:08:52.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.36,0:08:52.31,Alt,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.76,0:09:03.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Lady Jeanne!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.25,0:09:06.63,Main,,0,0,0,,How is my fiancé faring?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.29,0:09:08.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.79,0:09:10.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Something seems to be wrong with him.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.99,0:09:13.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I suspect that he's—
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.77,0:09:16.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Eh? Making him drink water isn't going to help.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.95,0:09:21.46,Main,,0,0,0,,The drug's already running through his system.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.72,0:09:24.59,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by "drug"?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.12,0:09:26.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't that obvious?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.60,0:09:29.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Alcohol alone would never leave him like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.26,0:09:31.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I agree.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.47,0:09:34.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure, they forced him to drink some booze at the pub,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.48,0:09:36.60,Main,,0,0,0,,but this is clearly the work of a drug.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.00,0:09:40.02,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a concoction of sleeping pills and narcotics.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.02,0:09:42.85,Main,,0,0,0,,It rarely gets used because of the high price tag,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.22,0:09:47.04,Main,,0,0,0,,but in my experience it's especially useful for human trafficking
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.04,0:09:48.86,Main,,0,0,0,,when you need to nab a target.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.86,0:09:51.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't set a bad example for Khemet!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.61,0:09:53.01,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ow!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.88,0:09:53.26,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a powerful drug.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.26,0:09:55.87,Main,,0,0,0,,How could this happen to a crown prince?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.87,0:09:58.76,Main,,0,0,0,,You're making a mountain out of a molehill, Sir Knight.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.76,0:10:02.41,Main,,0,0,0,,The effects of the drug will wear off\N if we let him sleep for the night.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.20,0:10:05.62,Main,,0,0,0,,But this is no small incident!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.62,0:10:07.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone at the pub must've drugged him!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.89,0:10:13.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Not quite. The drug was already\Nin the boy when he got there.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.28,0:10:17.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd been keeping tabs on him at the castle, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.08,0:10:21.78,Main,,0,0,0,,A couple of men literally carried him out of there.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.78,0:10:24.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Couldn't even walk on his own.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.16,0:10:28.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I followed them, and not only did they bring him to the pub,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.93,0:10:33.28,Main,,0,0,0,,but they forced alcohol on him\N before throwing down some money and leaving.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.03,0:10:37.98,Main,,0,0,0,,He was probably drugged first\N and then dragged out there.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.80,0:10:43.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, I got to enjoy some good booze\N thanks to them, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.54,0:10:47.54,Main,,0,0,0,,So he was given the drug while still at the castle?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.30,0:10:51.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a catastrophic security breach?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.92,0:10:55.80,Main,,0,0,0,,If that's true, then it's more than just a breach.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.80,0:10:57.12,Main,,0,0,0,,This was an abduction.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.49,0:11:01.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Drugging a prince to take him\N out of the castle is beyond a serious crime.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.20,0:11:13.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Elder Sister?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.46,0:11:16.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Ooh, such anger from my mistress!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.61,0:11:20.45,Main,,0,0,0,,The people who set Prince Leon up...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.95,0:11:24.71,Main,,0,0,0,,are second prince Erwin and third prince Homer.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.71,0:11:37.22,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the game, they frequently came to visit\Ntheir heartbroken brother Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.74,0:11:40.53,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then, if Tiara takes the Leon route,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.53,0:11:43.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}she happens to meet them outside of Leon's room,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.16,0:11:47.75,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and she learns some of the truth\N of what happened two years earlier.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.75,0:11:50.99,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They were jealous of their\N older brother's claim to the throne
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.99,0:11:53.58,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and spread bad rumors about him.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.58,0:11:58.24,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All the talk of him being flirtatious\N and womanizing were just baseless lies!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.72,0:12:01.44,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the game, when Tiara probes further...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.87,0:12:04.45,Main,,0,0,0,,We only gave him a little wine,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.45,0:12:07.51,Main,,0,0,0,,then had some servants take him down to the pub.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.80,0:12:10.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A little wine? Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.70,0:12:14.88,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The brothers said Leon got drunk from some celebratory wine and they tended to him
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.88,0:12:16.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}before leaving him in his room.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.52,0:12:20.89,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then they claimed that Leon drunkenly wandered out of the castle by himself,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.89,0:12:23.37,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}which Leon himself took as fact!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.35,0:12:27.14,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At least until Tiara uncovers the truth
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.14,0:12:29.62,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and tells him what his brothers really did.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.08,0:12:38.57,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They set up their own brother by drugging him!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.57,0:12:40.54,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those pieces of trash!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.03,0:12:45.34,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I thought it would be okay if I just convinced Leon not to leave the castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.34,0:12:50.42,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it turned out that wasn't even the problem!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.18,0:12:55.59,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And worse yet, from what I know about those brothers...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.43,0:13:00.55,Main,,0,0,0,,They will not get away with this.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.28,0:13:06.68,Main,,0,0,0,,When Prince Leon awakens tomorrow,\N I will explain the situation to him.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.24,0:13:10.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As fellow royalty, I cannot let this absurdity stand!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.36,0:13:14.84,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will put a stop to them in this world!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.46,0:13:28.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.51,0:13:31.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you awake, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.52,0:13:32.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.95,0:13:34.84,Main,,0,0,0,,My name is Callum.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.48,0:13:38.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you remember what happened last night?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.49,0:13:40.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Last night...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.24,0:13:43.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I had wine with my brothers...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.08,0:13:46.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen calmly, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.95,0:13:51.20,Main,,0,0,0,,We found you collapsed at a pub last night\Nand took you to safety.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.20,0:13:52.63,Main,,0,0,0,,At a pub?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.48,0:13:55.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no! I'm late!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.76,0:13:58.57,Main,,0,0,0,,What time is it?! I have to go!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.70,0:14:01.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Please take it easy.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.93,0:14:02.95,Main,,0,0,0,,All is well.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.32,0:14:06.40,Main,,0,0,0,,We will see you to the castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.40,0:14:08.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm deeply grateful for your help.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.26,0:14:13.60,Main,,0,0,0,,And my apologies, but I must get home immediately.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.60,0:14:16.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to go see my fiancée!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.09,0:14:19.34,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no need for that, Prince Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.03,0:14:23.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Pride?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.49,0:14:24.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.72,0:14:30.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I was concerned after I gave you advice that night,\Nso I came here undercover to see you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.50,0:14:34.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Please excuse my doing so.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.01,0:14:43.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Prince Stale is here as well?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.03,0:14:47.15,Main,,0,0,0,,You mustn't, Prince Leon!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.15,0:14:51.96,Main,,0,0,0,,A member of a royal family should never beg pardon from a false charge like this!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.98,0:14:53.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Pride!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.33,0:14:55.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.63,0:15:00.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though you went out of your way\Nto warn me that night, I still...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.26,0:15:02.78,Main,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.78,0:15:04.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I know everything that happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.32,0:15:07.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I know you were drugged,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.93,0:15:11.25,Main,,0,0,0,,and that you were made to leave the castle against your will.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.68,0:15:18.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I also know the rumors about your womanizing\Naround town are entirely groundless.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.98,0:15:20.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Prince Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.22,0:15:23.91,Main,,0,0,0,,The ones who drugged you and tried to frame you
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.91,0:15:25.70,Main,,0,0,0,,are your own brothers.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.91,0:15:27.19,Main,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.19,0:15:30.84,Main,,0,0,0,,You remember nothing after drinking that wine last night, correct?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.84,0:15:36.14,Main,,0,0,0,,If so, then let's head to the castle,\Nand talk everything over with His Majesty the King.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.14,0:15:37.17,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.62,0:15:40.60,Main,,0,0,0,,If we do, we'll lose the heirs to the throne...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.97,0:15:43.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Those two must've done it for the good of the country!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.70,0:15:48.43,Main,,0,0,0,,If they were thinking about the country,\Nthey would never have done such a wicked thing!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.74,0:15:53.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Enough already! Wake up, Leon Adonis Coronaria!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.88,0:15:56.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Where does your purpose lie?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.44,0:16:00.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Remember what you stand for! Your heartfelt desire!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.08,0:16:04.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Right now, you have me on your side.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.08,0:16:07.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You have my brother and our knights, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.82,0:16:13.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure if we go to him now,\N the king will listen to what you say!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.35,0:16:16.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Prince Leon...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.67,0:16:19.49,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it that you love above all else?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.95,0:16:25.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.24,0:16:33.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I love you, Pride Royal Ivy...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.10,0:16:34.51,Main,,0,0,0,,and you alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.75,0:16:40.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Give it up, Leon!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.12,0:16:42.55,Main,,0,0,0,,That was not from your heart!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.92,0:16:48.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I am not the one you love!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.94,0:16:51.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Embrace your own desires!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.85,0:16:58.66,Main,,0,0,0,,This is your only chance!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.00,0:17:02.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Before everything slips through your fingers!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.48,0:17:04.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Face your true feelings!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.56,0:17:10.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Prince Leon, what you will always love\N from the bottom of your heart...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.53,0:17:12.68,Main,,0,0,0,,are the people of your nation!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.93,0:17:25.17,Main,,0,0,0,,But I can't!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.92,0:17:27.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to leave this country!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.86,0:17:33.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, these impure needs I have\N will affect the citizens I love...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.07,0:17:38.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I've fallen in love with my people...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.88,0:17:46.46,Main,,0,0,0,,But I cannot expose them to my desires,\N my narcissism, my possessiveness!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.78,0:17:50.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't become king!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.97,0:17:55.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What makes you think you're unfit for the throne?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.53,0:18:02.04,Main,,0,0,0,,There is nothing impure about your desire.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.04,0:18:04.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Whose approval are you searching for?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.00,0:18:06.21,Main,,0,0,0,,The people's, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.14,0:18:12.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Wanting the people to approve of you,\Nor wanting to become a king the people desire...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.33,0:18:14.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is the sin in any of that?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.18,0:18:18.40,Main,,0,0,0,,When did you become a narcissist?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.40,0:18:21.10,Main,,0,0,0,,You've always loved the people, never yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.10,0:18:22.91,Main,,0,0,0,,You opened your heart to them.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.65,0:18:30.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Or are you telling me that interacting\Nwith the people has given you a big head?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.71,0:18:32.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by "possessiveness"?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.01,0:18:36.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about your desire to be loved by your citizens?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.97,0:18:39.20,Main,,0,0,0,,That's only natural!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.78,0:18:43.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Because you cherish the people of this country!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.44,0:18:46.56,Main,,0,0,0,,And have for a long, long time!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.56,0:18:48.96,Main,,0,0,0,,That isn't possessiveness.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.96,0:18:54.15,Main,,0,0,0,,It's precisely {\i1}because{\i0} you've dedicated yourself\Ntime and time again to the happiness of your people
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.15,0:18:56.07,Main,,0,0,0,,that you hoped to be loved.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.36,0:19:02.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Besides, even if the people didn't love you,\Nyou would still be a champion for them.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.67,0:19:07.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Because you are a respectable person\N who always puts others ahead of himself!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.48,0:19:17.77,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the game world,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.77,0:19:21.99,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Leon remained in the Kingdom of Freesia as Pride's fiancé.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.74,0:19:27.95,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As the days went on and she continued tormenting him, he still endured it all.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.46,0:19:31.79,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that wasn't because he had no other place to go.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.48,0:19:37.63,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He did it to maintain the alliance between Freesia and his beloved country.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.28,0:19:44.14,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even heartbroken and trapped in a room\Nhe could never escape from, he held fast.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.64,0:19:48.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You mean, these feelings are okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.38,0:19:50.63,Main,,0,0,0,,They're not impure?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.63,0:19:51.89,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.89,0:19:54.38,Main,,0,0,0,,It's okay for you to embrace your desires.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.78,0:20:00.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Because your noble heart will surely guide you down the correct path.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.39,0:20:07.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want to leave the Anemone Kingdom!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.85,0:20:11.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Trade relations are going well!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.10,0:20:15.86,Main,,0,0,0,,In the future, we'll gather a lot of resources\N and this nation will undoubtedly become rich!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.86,0:20:17.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Children in the city told me
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.44,0:20:22.37,Main,,0,0,0,,that in the future, they want to collect goods from around the world and become merchants!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.37,0:20:29.62,Main,,0,0,0,,A month ago, a farm family on the outskirts smiled\Nand told me that they had cultivated new produce!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.62,0:20:32.70,Main,,0,0,0,,They said they wanted me to try it someday!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.48,0:20:38.96,Main,,0,0,0,,The last time I went to town,\N a woman let me hold her baby!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.96,0:20:40.89,Main,,0,0,0,,She'd even named him after me!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.90,0:20:46.25,Main,,0,0,0,,She hoped her child would\Ngrow up to be as kind as I am!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.79,0:20:49.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Even after my bad reputation spread around town,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.30,0:20:52.65,Main,,0,0,0,,everyone, every last one of them\N said they believed in me!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.65,0:20:55.16,Main,,0,0,0,,They smiled at me, without fail!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.15,0:20:58.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I love it!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.54,0:20:59.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I love this country!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.96,0:21:07.35,Main,,0,0,0,,There you have it.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.90,0:21:10.12,Main,,0,0,0,,That is your truth.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.90,0:21:15.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Prince Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.74,0:21:18.63,Main,,0,0,0,,This is why I'm here.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.06,0:21:23.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I came all this way to help you get everything back.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.17,0:21:25.36,Main,,0,0,0,,All of it?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.62,0:21:29.56,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll go together.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.56,0:21:31.65,Main,,0,0,0,,All of us will join you.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.87,0:21:37.78,Main,,0,0,0,,If you embrace your resolve and take my hand...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.03,0:21:44.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I will do everything in my power\N to ensure your happiness!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:27.03,0:23:32.72,Main,,0,0,0,,The Most Heretical Last Boss Queen:\N From Villainess to Savior.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:33.22,0:23:37.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Episode 4: "The Cruel Queen Makes a Declaration".
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.92,0:04:04.65,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(150,150)\t(2580,2730,\1a&HFF&)}Every day's unique, you get one chance at it
Dialogue: 2,0:04:01.92,0:04:04.65,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\bord0\fad(150,150)}Every day's unique, you get one chance at it
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.65,0:04:06.96,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(150,150)\t(2160,2310,\1a&HFF&)}So you'd better make it count
Dialogue: 2,0:04:04.65,0:04:06.96,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\bord0\fad(150,150)}So you'd better make it count
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.96,0:04:09.88,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(150,150)\t(2770,2920,\1a&HFF&)}When people flaunt morality
Dialogue: 2,0:04:06.96,0:04:09.88,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\bord0\fad(150,150)}When people flaunt morality
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.88,0:04:13.49,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(150,150)\t(3460,3610,\1a&HFF&)}You've gotta beware they've got their own agenda
Dialogue: 2,0:04:09.88,0:04:13.49,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\bord0\fad(150,150)}You've gotta beware they've got their own agenda
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.49,0:04:16.40,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(150,150)\t(2760,2910,\1a&HFF&)}Somewhere in your head, there's a voice that's messin' with ya
Dialogue: 2,0:04:13.49,0:04:16.40,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\bord0\fad(150,150)}Somewhere in your head, there's a voice that's messin' with ya
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.40,0:04:18.54,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(150,150)\t(1990,2140,\1a&HFF&)}Don't ever let it turn you 'round
